{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O smoldering clouds, let INAZUMA's lightning split the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest title in the hyperdimensional football RPG series &quot;Inazuma Eleven&quot; is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story featuring a new protagonist, over 5,400 characters to collect and train, as well as an intense competitive mode; there is no shortage of activities to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new story takes place 25 years after the first Inazuma Eleven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of a world without football, protagonist Destin Billows enrolls at South Cirrus Junior High. Meanwhile, within the prestigious Raimon Junior High - renowned as the top team in the nationals - rises a Football Monster named Harper Evans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When these two cross paths, a tale begins to unfold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Chronicle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster spanning over 5,400 characters from previous entries in the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive past Inazuma Eleven matches with Victorio, the boy who came from the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various teams, collect and train characters, and build your ultimate dream team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Bond Station (Kizuna Station)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange nostalgic objects from the Inazuma Eleven series to create your own &quot;Bond Town&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar, invite friends over and enjoy socializing and playing matches together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your custom made avatar can also be used in matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 The Ultimate Anime Experience Brought to Life by MAPPA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game anime cutscenes were made in cooperation with animation studio MAPPA!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the longest anime runtime in the series' history, the story's intensity will reach new heights.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Heroes' Victory Road","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/3046d71d3c93473e80ccd7828a46d2f7aa3e97bd.jpg"},{"name":"You Still Have Football","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"From Zero to Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"The Day Football Changed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"Invasion of the Football Monster!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"The Crybaby Rival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"Come Together, Football Club!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"Keshin in the Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"Alice's Wonderland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/33f7909b57ab56c37dc4dd72927bda6c48c5ea05.jpg"},{"name":"Sunshine Through the Clouds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799860/6470e0ce00e421e5ab77b30bdf5396744916eb1d.jpg"}],"total":52},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2799860?t=1764296831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764296831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799860/9ee2aa35c24c19588eec70c6f7ff94f6efa26b1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764296831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799860/9ee2aa35c24c19588eec70c6f7ff94f6efa26b1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764296831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799860/extras/3f7b8baff813f7b7f49e1a09e33e9583.avif?t=1764296831\" width=1040 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;INAZUMA ELEVEN: Victory Road Deluxe Edition&quot; is a value package which adds the following bonus content to the base game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Package Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Base Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose-a-Character Crate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bond Object: Football Club Room (Raimon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bond Object: Rai Rai Noodles (Inazuma Town)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Promise Pendant (equipment that boosts EXP gained)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Victory Jump! (Goal Celebration)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*For more details on the bonuses included with each edition, visit the official website.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O smoldering clouds, let INAZUMA's lightning split the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest title in the hyperdimensional football RPG series &quot;Inazuma Eleven&quot; is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story featuring a new protagonist, over 5,400 characters to collect and train, as well as an intense competitive mode; there is no shortage of activities to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new story takes place 25 years after the first Inazuma Eleven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of a world without football, protagonist Destin Billows enrolls at South Cirrus Junior High. Meanwhile, within the prestigious Raimon Junior High - renowned as the top team in the nationals - rises a Football Monster named Harper Evans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When these two cross paths, a tale begins to unfold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Chronicle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster spanning over 5,400 characters from previous entries in the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive past Inazuma Eleven matches with Victorio, the boy who came from the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various teams, collect and train characters, and build your ultimate dream team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Bond Station (Kizuna Station)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange nostalgic objects from the Inazuma Eleven series to create your own &quot;Bond Town&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar, invite friends over and enjoy socializing and playing matches together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your custom made avatar can also be used in matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 The Ultimate Anime Experience Brought to Life by MAPPA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game anime cutscenes were made in cooperation with animation studio MAPPA!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the longest anime runtime in the series' history, the story's intensity will reach new heights.</p>","developers":["LEVEL5 Inc."],"dlc":[3550790],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799860/d7e5240b6182e4a085a365503b22aefd2e6ae6cf/header.jpg?t=1764296831","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799860/748835151/75f0013c46bbfdee52bb2c66762afe3ec1ae54d9/1763103296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764231498","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799860/748835151/75f0013c46bbfdee52bb2c66762afe3ec1ae54d9/1763103296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764231498","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799860/748835151/75f0013c46bbfdee52bb2c66762afe3ec1ae54d9/1763103296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764231498","id":257231390,"name":"Final Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257231390/16c4132773e3226c6eb40c34dd904f771c3e6b7c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764231498"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799860/692807052/b477ad277987060a0815eabccbdfd86b9a2b8219/1764144024/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764227645","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799860/692807052/b477ad277987060a0815eabccbdfd86b9a2b8219/1764144024/dash